 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Wall light: 47 flat models cut to 17 plus 11 archetypes (Serge Mouille, Lampe Gras, Jieldé, AJ, PH 2/1, Potence, Hansen swing-arm, Sarfatti 2065 and 262 (Astep), IC Lights (Flos), Bumling); old 'Swing-arm sconce' generic model became the Hansen archetype and a 't' type; Astep Model 262 and Bumling moved from m to archetypes; IC Lights moved from ranges to archetype; IKEA/Lindby/Lucande range lists cut (ranges repeat across kinds). Dropped: Wästberg w127 (retrieved evidence shows it is a desk/clamp lamp by Dirk Winkel, not a wall light); Lampe Gras original year not on retrieved page so left blank. Mirror light: 36 models (Eglo/Paulmann SKU flood) cut to 9 across market brands. Under-cabinet light: IKEA-only list cut to 4 IKEA plus 3 Bob Vila test picks (Litever best overall, Wobane best value, Brilliant Evolution best puck). Sources: retailer/maker pages, 1stdibs, chairish, Bob Vila."
}